comments:
If I ever return to Dublin (and I pray that I do) I plan to stay with Hans and Deirdre again because…
i) H&D are both the bomb! – gracious, entertaining, helpful, accommodating… and Deirdre makes the BEST poached eggs;
ii) location… we walked everywhere – Trinity Collage, Steven’s Green, The Temple Bar district, the must-see churches, Brazen Head and other great pubs and restaurants, and to the DART station for a day trip down to Dalkey, Sandycove and Greystones;
iii) the glorious Georgian-style house – the home is warm and charming and our room was spacious, the beds comfortable and the linens divine 3

Ma fille et moi avons passé un séjour fantastique chez Des et Sinead. Ils sont d'une extrême gentillesse, un sens de l'hospitalité extraordinaire. En plus, ils ne manquent pas d'humour. Nous avons beaucoup ri et ils aiment discuter avec vous. On a le sentiment de faire tous partie de la même famille. On est comme à la maison.
En arrivant, j'ai même eu le droit à un bon verre de vin. Des et Sinead font tout pour vous aider à passer un excellent séjour en Irlande. Leurs chiens sont également très attachants.
Je vous souhaite un jour de rencontrer Des et Sinead, ils sont supers! Je recommande fortement ce lieu d'accueil où la joie et la bonne humeur sont au rendez-vous;

-Very good value and experience.
- House is very clean and tidy and suitable for guests;
- There welcome is immediately warm, friendly and at ease;
- Breakfast was generous and fun (thanks for the sausages Ger) ...

Id highly recommend

TRES BONNE SITUATION (ENVIRON 20 MNS DE TRINITY COLLEGE À PIED)
IL Y A DES BUS POUR REJOINDRE LE CENTRE, ON N'EST PAS LOIN DU DART (10 MNS ENVIRON)
APPARTEMENT TRÈS JOLI, AVEC TOUT L'EQUIPEMENT NECESSAIRE;

Non vi è necessità di spendere chissà quante parole: Aidan è un ospite fantastico; cordiale e disponibile, sempre disposto ad aiutare per organizzarsi al meglio;
la stanza è pulita e confortevole, la casa pacifica; si trova 10 minuti a piedi dal centro, e molto comoda anche per il business park;
ve lo consiglio!

The house was exactly as described :
- spacious ;
- clean ;
- kids friendly (nice garden, tree house).
Nice area.
We enjoyed our stay in Rathgar.

great welcome;
precise description;
district very close to the center within walking distance.

I enjoyed my stay at Vini s  house. however, in my opinion, there are some things that could be better, in order to improve the stay of Guests, such as:

- allways garantee hot water, sometimes, the water was cold;
-put windows with better isolation, there was too much noise from the street because of the traffic;
- be more prepared to receive tourists. it would be nice if you had maps of the city, information about the public transports, ways to get to the airport, etc.

L appartement était effectivement bien situé à côté de la station du dart mais c est tout. 
L absence de rideau sur le velux de la chambre ne permet pas de dormir correctement. Nous étions 3 et il n y avait pas une chaise par personne, nous avons du manger sur le lit dans la chambre car nous ne tenions pas sur la table de la cuisine (qui servait aussi d entrée commune de la maison), seul un micro onde nous a permis de réchauffer de la nourriture. Notre voisin de chambre nous a preté son tabouret qui nous a servi de mini table dans la chambre....
Inese était la pour nous accueillir le premier jour; elle a répondu sans hésiter à mes questions et a téléphoné 2 fois de suite à ma demande pour m aider dans mes démarches mais je ne l ai jamais revu ensuite...Nous avons quitté la chambre en saluant son mari.Je regrette le manque d informatons ou de précisions sur cette chambre qui ne permet pas à mon sens de rester plusieurs jours à plusieurs personnes parcequ'on ne pouvait ps cuisiner ou manger à table. Dommage;

2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms; large kitchen/ living room;
erything was clean;
shops and buses near by; to walk into the city (as we did) took only about 15 minutes; 
there is wi-fi in the flat...
I would go there again.

When you go to Barry, you should know:

- He is Irish, which includes a lot of laughs, great (really great) hospitality and the occasional backyard axe throw;
- The location is just outside of the buzzing Dublin city center, easily reachable by bus (and I mean easily, it stops in front of the house and leaves about every 15-30 mins);
- You can have a quiet stay at his house, or be social in the living room area;
- Several restaurants and 2 grocery stores are close by;
- Try 'The village bistro' for their full Irish breakfast!

Overall we had a great stay and we're definitely visiting again.

We booked this AirBnb based solely on reviews and we were not disappointed! Carmel and Diarmuid's place was absolutely lovely.  

The pictures posted online are exactly the same as the apartment you walk into;   The location is in a safe, clean, quiet area along the canal which makes you feel like you are outside of the the city even though it is only a short walk away;   
The response rate to any questions we had throughout booking was close to, if not, immediate; 
There is everything you will need for making your meals, finding your way around the city, extra blankets etc.; 
The best of all are the nice little touches around the apartment - including a warm welcome of beer, wine and snacks  on arrival.   

The only minor challenge we had was with parking.  There are limited options other than 3 hour curbside parking in the near area.  If possible, it would be ideal to simply visit without a vehicle as you do not need one in the city!

We will definitely stay again at Carmel & Diarmuid's AirBnb when in Dublin again and have already recommended it to several people!

Myla & Chris

Very friendly,welcoming and easy-going young couple;
quite a small room with a comfortable bed in a house that is clean and  normally quiet at night;
quite convenient location:less than 5 minutes'walk to shops, pub and icing on the cake to bus stop to city center
quite clear information sent by Brian to get to the house and inside it
Conclusion:perfect pied-à-terre  for a small budget in a friendly house, to be recommended

Appartement bien situé et de bonne taille;
Il manque un 2ème jeu de clés pour un groupe de 5 à 6. Hortense et son colocataire nous ont très bien accueillis et ont récupéré très gentiment un colis pour nous.
Bonne adresse

Posizione molto buona, a 10 minuti di bus dal centro, anche se poco servita come supermarket o altro; 
Piccolo problema con gli scarichi wc, che i proprietari hanno prontamente sistemato, nonostante fossero fuori città. Il palazzo era dotato anche di bagni comuni pertanto abbiamo sopperito al problema per il primo giorno.
Appartamento grazioso e accogliente.

Hallo (; 
der Aufenthalt war perfekt für uns. Wir kamen erst um halb 2 in der früh bei der Unterkunft an. Die schlüsselübergabe war kein problem obwohl die gastgeber schon geschlafen haben!!! 
Die gastgeberin selbst hab ich leider nicht persönlich getroffen. Doch ihr freund bit uns am nächsten morgen kaffee und frühstück an :) 
Die Atmosphäre und Stimmung war wirklich locker und freundlich.
Das schlafzimmer ist ein Wintergarten der umfunktioniert wurde. Sehr schön hergerichtet mit guten bett!! Haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und alles war sehr unkompliziert (; 
Perfekte übernachtungsmöglichkeit für nen zwischenstopp 👍🏻☺️

Lovely host;
Lovely place;
Lovely dogs;
Very easy transportation to city.

Apartamento estupendo, tal como aparece en la publicidad;
Sin duda un  sitio para volver !!!
Staphen es unha persona muy cordial y detallista que nos tenía preparado un precioso detalle de bienvenida;
El apartamento está bien situado; nosotros fuimos siempre  caminando ...

- Super réactivité et disponibilité du propriétaire;
- Bonne organisation;
- Certaines attentions, t.q: adapteur (qui peut être facilement oublié), lonely planet, etc.
